# mt5docker environment configuration example.
# Copy to config/.env (or export before docker compose) and fill your values.
#
# The demo provisioning path is ENABLED by default: with
# MT5_AUTO_CREATE_DEMO=1 the container provisions a reproducible
# MetaQuotes-Demo terminal on first boot without manual credentials.

# --- MT5 account (required for a manual-login terminal) ----------------------
MT5_LOGIN=your_login_number
MT5_PASSWORD=your_password
MT5_SERVER=MetaQuotes-Demo

# --- Zero-touch demo provisioning --------------------------------------------
# 1 = provision a demo terminal automatically (no credentials needed)
MT5_AUTO_CREATE_DEMO=1

# --- Container surface (optional; defaults avoid port clashes) ---------------
# MT5_VNC_PORT=3000
# MT5_GRPC_PORT=8001
# SKIP_DOCKER=1
